WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.370
As long as justice exists in this world,

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.920
(Narrate by Kohji Moritsugu)
evil would still remain.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:08.920
Behind the war between justice and evil,

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:12.210
there is a group of unknown warriors.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.290
(Azamino Bar)

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:17.500
So, everyone.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:20.080
(Monster Development Department of Agastia)
Thank you for your effort today.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:23.290
(Touka Kuroitsu, Assistant)
Wish everyone have higher achievements.

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:26.830
Cheers!

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:33.710
(Wolf Bete, Novice Assistant)
This is my time coming to the after-work drinks.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:36.750
(Long Range Sniper, Cannon Thunderbird)
You're overacting, senior.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.890
(Genuine Hydra, the Triple-regenerated Monster)
It's my time attending this too.

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:42.420
Great to have so many of you all here.

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:43.920
Professor.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.370
(Professor Hajime Sadamaki)
That's right.

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:48.920
Many tend not to come to the drinking gathering
after work recently.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:50.660
Apart from this...

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:52.210
(Immortal Camula, Leader of Omnipotent Cell)
Yeah.

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:54.460
(Adamant, Magnetic Ore Monster)
It's been some time joining after-work drinks.

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:58.040
Guys, let's be relaxed tonight.

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:00.830
Why is Madam Camula here?

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:03.170
She's not part of Development Department, right?

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:05.670
Even it's the case, I still...

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.120
Raise your hand if you're available
for the gathering tonight.

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:08.830
- Me.
- I'm in.

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:10.670
- Because she seemed interested to join us.
- Me.

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:12.090
(Melty)
Me...

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:19.980
Wouldn't she be pitiful
if I didn't ask her under such circumstances?

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:22.170
Even if you're right,

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:25.480
we'd be on tenterhooks to stay with leaders.

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:28.920
If so, we should come out with something
to settle this.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.540
By ourselves.

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:45.370
♫Keep striving to march forward
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:48.210
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:52.330
♫Live within the current power♫

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:55.460
♫Special force♫

00:01:55.460 --> 00:02:01.620
(Miss Kuroitsu from the Monster Development Department)
♫Special force♫

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:07.040
♫Everyone possesses this power (Power)♫

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:09.780
♫Being locked up without realising it♫

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:12.150
♫You are the courageous flower (Flower)♫

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:14.910
♫Fighting against with nonsense today♫

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:17.040
♫Warfare against the sleepiness in the morning♫

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.790
♫Psychological warfare begins at forenoon,
bringing the project to the meeting♫

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:23.500
♫Don't lose. You'll be fine♫

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.420
♫It's gonna be ok!!♫

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:28.040
♫The hardworking one deserves respect♫

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.550
♫You'll be rewarded one day♫

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:33.470
♫Wake up and believe in this power.
Do it again♫

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:36.580
♫Everyone is special.
Only one, Let's go!!♫

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:40.010
♫Keep striving to march forward
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.470
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:47.270
♫Persistence empowers you.
The important special force♫

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:50.750
♫Keep striving to march forward today
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.530
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:56.160
♫Keep it up. Stronger♫

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:59.960
♫With your beautiful special force♫

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:02.330
(Episode 7: The Whereabouts of Passion
Dedicated to Demon's Feast)

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:03.960
(That Lost in the Fragrant Poison of Sweet Hug,
Indulged Amidst Sin Together With God's Avatar.)

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:04.620
Draught beer!

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:08.250
Isn't this the tagline
"I'll start with a draught beer"?

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.920
Can you drink it, senior?

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:13.550
Isn't your mental age a student?

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:18.290
It's fine. Monsters wouldn't get drunk.

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:20.040
I see.

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:22.040
It's not fun, then.

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:24.420
How bitter! What the heck is this?

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:26.270
So awful.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:29.080
After all, Wolf has a sweet tooth.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.540
Perhaps you order a glass of juice.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.670
That's what I'm thinking.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:35.040
Please give me a glass of grapefruit juice.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:38.280
Sure. A glass of grapefruit juice.

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:41.740
Let's drink sake.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:45.040
Please drink slowly, Madam Camula.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:47.670
What are you talking about, Adamant?

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:50.620
Didn't I just order you not to mind me?

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.460
Yes...

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:55.370
Looking at the menu...

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.460
I'd like to have Super Premium Sake 23.
Note: 23 refers to the ratio of polished rice.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:00.800
Yes. Super Premium Sake 23.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.810
Ordering such a premium sake at the beginning?

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:06.710
It's common sense to start
with premium sake.

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:08.960
Besides, if I ordered the cheap one,

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:12.170
- Wonder what kind of person is Madam Camula?
- It'd stop subordinates from ordering good sake.

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:13.540
Though I'm clueless about her,

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:17.370
normally, leaders who love joining drinking
gatherings are classified into three types.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:22.570
First, ask to free yourselves from etiquette,
yet the leader is the least etiquette person.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:26.290
Second, leaders allow you to free yourselves,
they wouldn't care about you at the moment.

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:29.870
However, they give you the attitude
the following day at work.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:33.250
The third type, leaders ask you to relax
and he wouldn't do anything after sitting down.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:35.500
You might be worried
as if you've done something wrong,

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.620
but, it's just because
the leaders have fallen asleep.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:41.120
Rather than saying it as a type,
I'd say this is the real form of Sir Megistus.

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:43.390
That's horrible.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:47.670
I don't think Madam Camula is the kind
who acts insanely after drinking.

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:51.330
Anyway, let's stay sober and observe first.

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:56.420
Here's the grapefruit juice
and Super Premium Sake 23.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:57.900
The juice is mine.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.900
Mine is Super Premium Sake.

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:04.910
I have a sinking feeling over them.
I'd better stay further away.

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:08.920
Is this chicken skewer your partner?

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:12.670
Well.

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:14.920
It's rare to have the chance
to take a drink with you all like this.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:18.710
Hey, you just ate two fried chicken in one go?

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:19.960
Give me water.

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:24.890
So, I'm the one who assembled your skeletons.

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:27.460
I'm sick of hearing this again.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:31.890
Senior, it seems you've gone off-topic.
Maybe you should care about yourself.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:34.500
What did you just say?

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.770
You were so obedient when you were just created.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:41.460
I'll make you end up like this chicken skewer.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:43.280
You've touched me.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.920
(Melty, the Chocolate Monster)
Speaking of which,

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:48.290
is it good for a bird monster
to eat the roasted chicken?

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:51.870
I'm the god in the legend,
it has nothing to do with fowls.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:55.040
If that's the case, you're the ingredient.
Right, Miss Melty?

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:01.830
I'm not edible
due to the metal found in me though.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:06.550
Wait. I'm sorry. This is not what I meant.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:08.210
Oh my.

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:10.040
You're so cute.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:17.080
They've touched me.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:19.880
I didn't know that you're so fluffy.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.950
Do you want to take a bite on me?

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:33.870
Did you see that? He has no manner at all.

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:37.540
Matsu is just right here though.
What an awful guy.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:41.000
But, I have more interest in
grilled octopus balls and sake. Can I order?

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.330
I think Elder Sister better not drink much.

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:46.750
It'll damage Matsu's liver.

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:50.710
But, Professor mentioned it's fine for us
just now.

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:53.230
Don't mind me.

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:56.500
Sisters, eat as you wish.

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:58.580
Don't you find it annoying?

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:02.740
No. Sisters are gentle women.

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:05.080
Even though they might say something unpleasant
sometimes.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:09.790
You always react like this, Professor.

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:12.620
It's not just about reaching the benchmark.

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.920
No. We'll face the problem of budget,
am I right?

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:20.120
It was settled when the burden of Suspension of
Car was lightened by the biological frame.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:23.000
No. Look at the statistics.

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:25.250
If you consider the rate of conversion,

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.500
there's room for more ideas.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:28.920
Am I right, Cannon?

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.390
Your parts work the same way, right?

00:07:30.390 --> 00:07:33.120
Yes...

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:35.140
That's not true. Miss Kuroitsu, you're wrong.

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:38.420
These are the statistics for last year.

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:41.040
Cannon is using Blue of No. 30,

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:43.000
which is the redesigned version.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.670
It doesn't match this statistic at all.

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:47.900
Drats.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:52.500
I seem to have joined a group
that I can't communicate.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.960
Besides, they're discussing the parts
inside my body,

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.910
and I can't leave halfway.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:00.670
Why are you pretending like you're a dowager,
you heads of the hydra.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:01.960
What did you say?

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.540
What a useless and superficial woman.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:05.580
I'm not a woman.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.960
- I'll change back to a guy again.
- And right at this moment...

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.500
- Wolf picked up a conflict.
- Uneducated shorties are under our concern.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:12.120
- What are you doing, senior?
- What kind of chocolate are you, Miss Melty?

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:13.250
-If she keeps messing with them,
-It's bitter chocolate at this side.

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:15.290
- She'd get another group involved.
- It's milk chocolate on this side.

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:16.580
But, I'm drinking beer now.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:19.560
- Probably I'll become chocolate with whiskey.
- But, we still have EAP as a method.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:23.610
It's noisy. Shut up.

00:08:23.610 --> 00:08:25.070
Oh no.

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:27.070
We were too focused on the conversation.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.080
You guys always...

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:39.080
said that I'm strict.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:42.170
That's why you run away from me?

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:46.090
It's for the work's sake.
I have no choice though.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.210
She has become so vulnerable.

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:50.840
I thought monsters don't get drunk?

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.960
She's always like this.

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:56.850
Madam Camula is someone who gets drunk
because of the vibes.

00:08:56.850 --> 00:08:58.850
What has happened?

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.790
Who made Madam Camula cry?

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:04.670
How could it be?

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:06.870
This brat is taken in by the vibes too.

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:09.360
No wonder I found something
that's fishy just now.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.860
Listen up.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.290
If this plate represents the organisation,

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:15.620
Development Department
would be the fried chicken on it.

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:17.460
And we monsters

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:19.500
are lemons.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:23.000
Cannon even has started lectures on this food.

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:26.630
I have no idea what he's talking about.

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:31.630
True. We share the same thought.
Because I'm like what you said.

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:35.880
Apparently, Melty is clueless about his words,
yet she went along with him.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:40.000
I feel that I'm lonely too.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:41.870
Because of Wolf...

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:43.710
Talk properly.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:47.960
What? Do you have a problem
with my drinking style?

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:51.960
Crybaby, happy soul, hotheaded,
and troublemaker.

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:54.660
Hydra has had them all in her.

00:09:57.170 --> 00:10:00.250
Someone like me...

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:02.920
Get me more sake.

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:05.170
Please use this to settle the bill.

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:08.580
And state katakana of "Agastia" on the receipt.

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.170
Sure.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:12.830
He's trying to settle the bill
with the company's fund

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:14.670
while Madam Camula isn't sober.

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:19.120
(Azamino Bar)
Great. Let's drink.

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:33.200
It's strange. I remembered
that I went to the drinking gathering...

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:36.460
Where's this place?

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:38.670
It's an unfamiliar room.

00:10:43.170 --> 00:10:46.790
One-night stand? No way.

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:50.540
Did I do something bad?

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:54.420
Miss Kuroitsu?

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:05.460
(Adamant, Magnetic Ore Monster)

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:12.710
Did Miss Kuroitsu bring me back to her house?

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:16.210
What should I do now? Wait. What did I do?

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:18.370
What did I do?

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:21.120
No, I can't recall it.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.700
What the heck have I done?

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:25.710
Good morning.

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:27.960
Wolf, you're not cooperative at all.

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:30.460
- How come...
- Miss Kuroitsu.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.710
I think she got up on the wrong side of the bed.

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:40.000
You got drunk yesterday,

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:42.220
so I brought you home.

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:45.040
Because this is the nearest place.

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:50.420
I'm sorry for that.

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:54.000
True. You'd better behave yourself next time.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:56.490
Monsters need energy too.

00:11:56.490 --> 00:12:00.960
If so, these pajamas...

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:02.790
I changed it for you.

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:04.250
I have cleaned your body too.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:06.460
How could it be?

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:08.710
Don't mind it.

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:14.000
I've seen your body many times
while fostering you.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.040
That's not the point.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.620
It's fine. No harm trying it.

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:22.750
There is. For example, harm to my dignity.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.510
So what?

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:27.170
I have to wash your clothes.

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.830
By the way, today's a rest day.

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:31.920
Do you want to hang out?

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:33.460
Certainly.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:36.030
You can wear my clothes.

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:37.960
How should I put it...

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:43.370
Though I know Miss Kuroitsu treats me...

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:46.290
Why am I wearing a dress again?

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:49.290
Because it suits you better.

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:52.460
It is, judging from my appearance.

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:54.080
But, it's airy below. I'm scared.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:55.830
It makes me feel uncomfortable.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:58.920
You look like you're cross-dressing like a man.

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:01.930
That's the truth though.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:03.790
I'm the only child in the family.

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:06.790
So, I'm happy with just seeing Wolf.

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:09.670
I think this is the feeling
of having a younger sister.

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:10.870
Younger sister?

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:12.560
Yes, my younger sister.

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:15.620
Can you take me as your younger brother instead?

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:17.120
Well. Let's go.

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:24.080
Honestly, I don't really care
about the clothing.

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:25.870
But, I don't like

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:28.700
to be treated as a girl by Miss Kuroitsu.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.880
But, how should I tell her?

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.000
It's a rooftop garden.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.370
It's my first time coming here.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:43.580
The breezy wind is soothing.

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:46.330
It's said that the udon noodle here is yummy.

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:48.500
Let's try.

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:51.730
Here you go. Sorry for the long waiting.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:14:00.490
Speaking of which, I don't know much about
Miss Kuroitsu's life aside from her work.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.330
Yummy.

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:08.420
Is it?

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.290
Listen, Wolf.

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:13.170
Regarding the idea of producing monsters,

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:15.500
we should always have a space in our brain
to think about it.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.500
It wouldn't come out on a whim.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:18.960
Therefore,

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:21.170
we can frequent public places

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:24.010
and observe people's actions.

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:26.790
"Perhaps that person can be redesigned
in this way."

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:29.830
"It seems the combination of this person
and this creature is a good one."

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:31.750
Keep thinking the ideas like this.

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:35.000
You look like a dangerous psychopath.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:39.170
However, Agastia doesn't allow
the redesign of humans.

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:42.580
So, these ideas couldn't be put into creation.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:46.540
Aren't you overzealous in immersing your mind
in work during holidays?

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:48.210
Am I?

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:52.420
I often play video games and sleep
during the holidays.

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:54.660
I'd go karaoke sometimes.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:58.920
Indeed, I involved too much in work
recently.

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:03.500
However, my goal is to advance to leadership.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:06.430
So, I'd force myself to work harder
to get some achievements.

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:10.750
Are you planning to become a leader?

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:14.040
Yes. That's why I went to
the fighting scene too.

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:17.920
I'm someone who won't strive if I have no goal.

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:21.000
I should climb to a higher place
to achieve the goal.

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:24.960
Due to manpower lacking,
so I stay at Development Department.

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:28.380
Probably I'll be transferred
to another department one day.

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:33.370
Therefore, I'm teaching you the tricks on
developing monsters.

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:36.380
Sorry, I need to go to the restroom.

00:15:40.420 --> 00:15:43.920
Apparently, I know nothing about

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:45.970
Miss Kuroitsu.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:50.000
No way. I can't stand being treated
as her sister.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:53.330
I must become a guy who can gain
acknowledgement from Miss Kuroitsu.

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.210
Miss.

00:15:55.980 --> 00:15:59.500
The lady who came with you asked us
to call for you.

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:00.980
Really?

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:03.460
She seems to have some trouble now.

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:05.540
Got it. Where is she?

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:11.330
It's a dead-end here.

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:13.490
Where's Miss Kuroitsu?

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:16.120
Well, please wait for a moment. Miss Monster.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:19.750
Can you be our company and have some fun?

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.250
Wolf.

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:25.120
How could you leave with someone you don't know?

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:27.510
Hang on.

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:29.790
Miss, do you want to join us?

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:32.760
Our technique is famously great.

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:35.210
What's happening now?
Are they striking up a conversation with me?

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:37.580
Are they hitting on me?

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:39.420
Are these guys idiots?

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:42.710
Hold on. Isn't it a great chance?

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:46.030
If I could settle these guys
and save Miss Kuroitsu...

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:49.580
You're awesome, Wolf!

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:50.530
Yes!

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:56.040
I'll try not to take away your life.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:58.410
Well, please keep us company.

00:16:58.670 --> 00:17:00.080
Right now.

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:14.600
Miss Kuroitsu.

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:17.580
Oh my. Be careful, Wolf.

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:21.040
Many people specially pick up on monsters.

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:23.620
So, they won't be sued if anything happens.

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:28.330
Aren't you a researcher, Miss Kuroitsu?

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:30.420
Why are you so good at fighting?

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:35.080
Because leaders can't be weaker than monsters.

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:37.370
Well, let's go now. I didn't beat them hard.

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:39.040
They might wake up soon.

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:44.870
Though I've said that I treat you as my sister.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:46.210
I've found something wrong with it.

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:51.170
I can't help but keep worrying about you.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.380
I haven't had this feeling before.

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:59.770
I don't think you're my sister, but my daughter.

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:02.000
What?

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.670
After all, I'm your inventor, Wolf.

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:07.420
Wolf's feeling towards Miss Kuroitsu

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:10.210
is getting more complex.

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.750
Can you treat me as your son instead?

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.830
You can do it, Wolf.

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:24.330
Erm...Miss Matsuyama.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:25.500
What's the matter?

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:29.000
Why did you involve in this work?

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.580
Because the pay is high.

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:32.830
Because bento is provided most of the time.

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.170
Is this the only reason?

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:38.790
Yes, do you have any issues?

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:41.310
If there's, I can report to the superiority.

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:43.810
No. Because it's very dangerous.

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:46.670
I don't think this job is suitable for ladies.

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:49.620
Besides, we kept losing.

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:51.540
Do you want to win?

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:54.070
Can we?

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:57.000
(Top Secret)
This is the material for tomorrow's work.

00:18:57.750 --> 00:19:02.370
There's an organisation, Dice
in Shirakawa of Fukushima.

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:05.620
The goal is Dharu Riser.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:08.040
But he's just an old man.

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:09.250
Old man?

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:10.460
Taking Dharma as its origin,

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:13.460
he'd stand up no matter how many times he falls.
That's why he's named Dharu Riser.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:15.420
(I Can Do It)
He's not a redesigned human

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:17.000
nor wearing an intensive combat costume.

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:20.350
But a local actor in some sort of costume
who's losing his popularity.

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:22.830
Isn't it cosplay?

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:24.920
If that's the case...

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:26.580
Perhaps we can win.

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:33.500
Dharu Riser is someone
who gets strong with any failure.

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:36.610
So, we can win if we beat him down.

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:40.120
We need to have strong courage.
For this, we need to have strong stamina.

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:43.000
You should train yourself hard until
you have enough strength to defeat him.

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:44.210
Yes.

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:49.250
To achieve a dream is to make it a reality.

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:53.000
My dream...

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.760
I...

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:57.120
want to beat the hero down.

00:19:57.120 --> 00:20:00.390
For this dream, I must beat him down first.

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:04.330
The victory will be nailed down tomorrow.

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:06.140
You should punch for tomorrow.

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:08.140
Punch.

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:10.290
Punch.

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:26.170
I protect Shirakawa,

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:28.750
I'm Dharu Riser.

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:35.960
♫The rain of determination
falls under the scorching sun♫

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:41.290
(Dharu Riser)
♫Get rid of the heat♫

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:46.020
♫Don't stop, carry on.
You can't change my destiny♫

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:51.000
♫Always be with you,
I can't see the light. Yeah!♫

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:56.420
♫Don't stop, carry on.
You can't change my destiny♫

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:58.860
(Blader)
♫Always be with you♫

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:06.330
♫Such an ordinary day♫

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:10.750
♫I'm willing to give up everything for you♫

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:16.170
♫Thousands of scars♫

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:20.130
♫Tears in eyes can no longer flow♫

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:25.790
♫Even the past that I want to erase from memory♫

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:30.000
♫Has become a weapon and let's get♫

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.250
♫Ready♫

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:36.210
♫Ignite my courage with the blade♫

00:21:36.210 --> 00:21:41.330
♫Split the path without an answer into two♫

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:44.500
(The Local Heroes in This Episode)
♫And march forward to the future♫

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:46.580
(Dharu Riser)
♫I must be stronger than before♫

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:50.000
(Dharu Riser)
♫Let go of the anxiety and run forward♫

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:51.410
(These Heroes Are Not Fictional but Real)
♫Let go of the anxiety and run forward♫

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:56.500
♫Don't stop, carry on.
You can't change my destiny♫

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:08.120
Dice…

00:22:10.790 --> 00:22:13.290
My muscles are sore, I can't move at all.

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:20.480
Did we win?

00:22:21.290 --> 00:22:24.860
No matter how many times I've fallen,
I'd stand up again.

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:33.870
Great...

00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:35.870
No matter what...

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:38.540
I'd still rise again, no matter what.

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:53.540
He's gone down, finally.

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:59.440
I'm a hero...

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:02.880
I won't give up...

00:23:04.250 --> 00:23:07.080
No matter what...

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:10.080
Hero...

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:11.750
No matter what...

00:23:11.750 --> 00:23:13.830
I'd still rise again, no matter what.

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:15.330
This hero...

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:17.750
I'm a hero.

00:23:21.590 --> 00:23:24.290
I couldn't stand up, even for once.

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:25.880
It's true though.

